== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: top2bf16ps [ENC: EVEX, MAP: 0F38, OPC: 0x5C]
     LENGTH:  6
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AMX_TILE
    ISA-SET: ACE_1
    ISA-EXT: ACE
 EXCEPTIONS: ACE_E4
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 F2 66 48 5C CA 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT      RW     MODRM_REG   8192    256      32   FLOAT32                         tmm1
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM    512     32      16  BFLOAT16                         zmm2
 2   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R        NDSNDD    512     32      16  BFLOAT16                         zmm3
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 512
  BROADCAST: NONE
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k0 [DISABLED]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: top2bf16ps %zmm3, %zmm2, %tmm1
   RELATIVE: top2bf16ps %zmm3, %zmm2, %tmm1

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: top2bf16ps tmm1, zmm2, zmm3
   RELATIVE: top2bf16ps tmm1, zmm2, zmm3

